WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.010
In 1095, a pope calls on
Christians to march to Jerusalem.

2
00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:10.120
The Crusades last until 1291,
fought in the name of God.

3
00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:13.790
Muslim, Jewish and
Christian civilians suffer.

4
00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:18.460
Today, some extremist groups still
claim religious reasons for violence.

5
00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:21.150
But when a war is waged
in the name of God,

6
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.330
is religion really the cause?

7
00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:26.320
In this mission, you'll
map the causes of war,

8
00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:30.230
from greed and retaliation
to history and resources.

9
00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:33.990
Then you'll hear the case against
religion and the replies to it,

10
00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:38.130
and test the claim that religion
is the main cause of war.

11
00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:41.950
Your mission: weigh up how
far religion causes war.
